  "Id": 1605,
  "Title": "\"Urinar\" - A Webinar on Transurethral Resection of Bladder Tumor (TURBT) and LASER Surgery Workshop",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "AKU's Section of Urology and Pakistan Association of Urological Surgeons (PAUS), Karachi chapter, held a webinar on TURBT and laser surgery for the prostate gland.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "AKU's Section of Urology and Pakistan Association of Urological Surgeons (PAUS), Karachi chapter, held a webinar on TURBT and laser surgery for the prostate gland. The strategic objective of the workshop was to align educational goals with clinical commitments, with the goal of providing comprehensive solutions for patients with treatment options that not only meet, but exceed current international standards of care. During the event the participants acquired cognitive and psychomotor skills, through lectures, small group discussions, and hands-on workshops on high fidelity simulators to achieve these goals."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The workshop was transmitted live to 7 centres around the country and also to centres in Cambodia. The webinar and workshop was attended in person by 40 urologists and urological trainees in Karachi. It was very well evaluated."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
